  "details": "One of the best profile features is the ability to display the languages a user speaks or understands, as it helps people find others they can easily communicate with. However, Persian (Farsi) is currently missing from the language selection list.\n\nThere is a growing Persian-speaking community on VRChat, including users from Iran and Persian speakers living around the world. Adding Persian as a selectable language would make it much easier for us to find one another, communicate naturally, and form positive communities within VRChat.\n\nThanks.",
